      ],
      "text": "Search this site Embedded Files Hearing & Brain Health Lab Megan Fitzhugh, PhD Assistant P rofessor Department of Neurosciences University of California San Diego We are actively recruiting for a research study on hearing and brain function! If you are between the ages of 60-80 years old and suspect you might have hearing loss, please e-mail Dr. Fitzhugh to learn how you can participate. mfitzhugh@ucsd.edu Our goal is to build a new line of research at the crossroads of cognitive aging and auditory neuroscience. We focus on understanding how age-related hearing loss changes the brain and why those changes may increase the risk of dementia. Google Sites Report abuse Page details Page updated Google Sites Report abuse",
